## PATCH 10: Incremental Training

**Problem:** Every retrain starts from scratch.

- [ ] Add `--append` flag to training scripts — adds new data to existing training set
- [ ] Store training data path in model metadata so you know what it was trained on
- [ ] Add `--warm-start` option that initializes models from previous weights (sklearn supports this for RF and GB)
- [ ] Track cumulative record count across training runs

