## PATCH 11: Logging & Error Handling

**Problem:** Mix of loguru and print statements. No log files. API returns raw tracebacks.

- [ ] Route all logs to a file: `data/logs/pipeline.log`
- [ ] Use structured logging (JSON format) so logs are parseable
- [ ] Remove bare `print()` statements — replace with logger calls
- [ ] Add proper FastAPI error handlers:
  - 400 for malformed input (with clear message)
  - 404 for models not found
  - 500 with sanitized error (no Python tracebacks to users)

